{
  "title": "Taqibaat e Namaz e Asr",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "Dua to be recited after Namaz-e-Asr\nبِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ \nBISMILLAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the name of Allah, the Beneficent, the Merciful.\nسُبْحَانَ اللّٰهِ وَالْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ وَ لَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللّٰهُ وَاللّٰهُ اَكْبَرُ \nSUBHAANALLAHE WAL HAMDO LILLAAHE WA LAA ELAAHA ILLALLAAHO WALLAAHO AKBAR, \nGlory be to Allah, all praise is due to Him! There is no god but Allah. \nوَ لَا حَوْلَ وَ لَا قُوَّۃَ اِلَّا بِاللّٰهِ الْعَلِیِّ الْعَظِیْمِ \nWA LAA HAWLA WA LAA QUWWATA ILLAA BILLAAHIL A’LIYYEEL A’ZEEM, \nAllah is the greatest; and there is no might and no strength but from Allah, the most superior, the All-tremendous. \nسُبْحَانَ اللّٰهِ بِالْغُدُوِّ وَالْاٰصَالِ \nSUBHAANAL LAAHE BIL GHODUWWE WAL AASAALE, \nGlory be to Allah at morning and evening. \nسُبْحَانَ اللّٰهِ بِالْعَشِیِّ وَ الْاِبكَارِ \nSUBHAANAL LAAHE BIL A’SHIYYE WAL IBKAARE, \nGlorify His purity when you enter upon the time of evening and morning. \nسُبْحَانَ اللّٰهِ حِیْنَ تُمْسُوْنَ وَ حِیْنَ تُصْبِحُوْنَ \nSUBHAANAL LAAHE HEENA TUMSOONA WA HEENA TUSBEHOON \nوَ الْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ فِیْ السَّمٰوَاتِ وَ الْاَرْضِ \nWA LAHUL HAMDO FIS-SAMAAWAATE WAL ARZE \nAnd to Him belongs praise in the heavens and the earth, \nوَ عَشِیًِّا وَ حِیْنَ تُظْھِرُوْنَ \nWA ASHIYYAN WA HEENA TUZHEROON, \nat night fall and mid-day. \nسُبْحَانَ رَبِّكَ رَبِّ الْعِزَّۃِ عَمَّا یَصِفُوْنَ \nSUBHAANA RABBEKA RABBIL I’ZZATE A’MMAA YASEFOON \nGlory be to Allah and all honour for He is free from the stories ascribed (about Him). \nوَ سَلَامٌ عَلَی الْمُرْسَلِیْنَ وَ الْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِیْنَ \nWA SALAAMUN A’LAL MURSALEENA WAL HAMDO LILLAAHE RABBIL A’ALAMEENA, \nPeace be on His apostles. And all praise rightly belongs to Allah – Lord of the worlds. \nسُبْحَانَ ذِیْ الْمُلْكِ وَالْمَلَكُوْتِ سُبْحَانَ ذِیْ الْعِزَّۃِ وَ الْجَبَرُوْتِ \nSUBHAANA ZIL MULKE WAL MALAKOOTE SUBHAANA ZIL I’ZZATE WAL JABAROOTE. \nGlory be to possessor of the dominion and the Kingdom. Glory be to possessor of might and invincibility.\nسُبْحَانَ الْحَیِّ الَّذِیْ لَا یَمُوْتُ \nSUBHAANAL HAYYIL LAZEE LAA YAMOOTO \nGlory be to the Living, the one Who will never die. \nسُبْحَانَ ذِیْ الْقَائِمِ الدَّائِمِ \nSUBHAANAL QAAEMID DAAA-EME. \nGlory be to the All-Self-existent, the Everlasting, \nسُبْحَانَ الْحَیِّ الْقَیُّوْمِ سُبْحَانَ عَلِیِّ الْاَعْلٰی \nSUBHAANAL HAYYUL QAYYUM, SUBHAANAL A’LIYYIL A’ALAA \nGlory be to the Living the Self-subsistent. \nسُبْحَانَهٗ وَ تَعَالٰی \nSUBHAANAHU WA TA-A’ALAA, \nGlory be to the All-high, the Most High. \nسُبُّوْحٌ قُدُّوْسٌ رَبُّنَا وَ رَبُّ الْمَلَآءِكَۃِ وَ الرُّوْحِ \nSUBBOOHUN QUDDOOSUN RABBONAA WA RABBUL MALAAA-EKATE WAR ROOHE. \nGlory be to Him and exalted be He, All-glory and All-holy, our Lord and the Lord of Angels and spirit. \nاَللّٰھُمَّ اِنَّ ذَنْبِیْ اَمْسٰی مُسْتَجِیْرًا بِعَفْوِكَ \nALLAAHUMMA INNAA ZANBI AMSAA MUSTAJEERAN BE A’FWEKA \nO Allah, surely my sin seeks the refuge of Thy pardon; \nوَ خَوْفِیْ اَمْسٰی مُسْتَجِیْرًا بِاَمْنِكَ \nWA KHAWFEE AMSAA MUSTAJEERAN BE AMNEKA \nand my fear seeks the refuge of Thy peace; \nوَ فَقْرِیْ اَمْسٰی مُسْتَجِیْرًا بِغِنَاكَ \nWA FAQREE AMSAA MUSTAJEERAN BE GHENAKA. \nand my indigence seeks the refuge of Thy self-sufficiency; \nوَذُلِّیْ اَمْسٰی مُسْتَجِیْرًا بِعِزِّكَ \nWA ZULLEE AMSAA MUSTAJEERAN BE-I’ZZEKA. \nand my abasement seeks the refuge of Thy exaltation. \nاَللّٰھُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ آلِ مُحَمَّدٍ \nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIN WA AALE MOHAMMADIN. \nO Allah! Bless Muhammad and the progeny of Muhammad, \nوَ اغْفِرْ لِیْ وَارْحَمْنِیْ اِنَّكَ حَمِیْدٌ مَّجِیْدٌ \nWAGHFIRLEE WAR HAMNEE INNAKA HAMEEDUN MAJEED. \nand pardon me, and have mercy on me, for surely Thou art the Praised and the Glorious. \nاَللّٰھُمَّ تَمَّ نُوْرِكَ فَھَدَیْتَ \nALLAAHUMMA TAMMA NOORAKA FA HADAYTA, \nO Allah! As Thy light has guided me, \nفَلَكَ الْحَمْدُ وَ عَظِیْمُ حِلْمُكَ فَعَفَوْتَ فَلَكَ الْحَمْدُ وَجْھِكَ \nFA LAKAL HAMDO WA A’ZOMA HILMOKA FA AFAWTA FA LAKAL HAMDO WAJHEKA, \nso all praise is due to Thee; and by the bounty of Thy clemency pardon me, so all praise is due to Thee \nرَبَّنَا اَكْرَمِ الْوُجُوْهِ وَ جَاھُكَ اَعْظَمُ الْجَاهِ \nRABBANAA AKRAMUL WOJOOHE WA JAAHOKA A-A’ZAMUL JAAHE \nO our Lord! Thou art the Most Generous of the generous and Thy Splendour is greater than all splendour, \nوَ عَطَائُكَ اَفْضَلُ الْاَعْطَاءِ تُعْطِیْ\nWA ATIYYATOKA, AFZALUL A’TAAA-E TO’TEE, \nand Thy gift is greater in merit than all gifts. \nرَبَّنَا فَتَشْكُرُ وَ تُؤْسَا فَتَغْفِرُ فَتُجِیْبَ الْمُضْطَرَّ \nRABBANAA FA-TASHKORO WA TO-A’SAA FA TAGHFERO FA-TOJEEBUL MUZTARRA \nThou thank those who obey thee and forgive when disobeyed, and grants the supplication of one in distress, \nوَ تَكْشِفِ الضُّرَّ وَ تَمْنِیْ مِنَ الْكَرْبِ \nWA TAKSHEFUZ ZURRA WA TUNJEE MENAL KARBE \nand removes the harm, and rescues from affliction, \nوَ تُغْنِ الفَقِیْرِ وَ تَشْفِ السَّقِیْمِ \nWA TUGHNIL FAQEERA WA TASH-FIS SAKEEME\nand enriches the indigent, and cures the ailing, \nوَ لَا یُجَازِیْ اٰلَائِكَ اَحَدٌ \nWA LAA YOJAAZEE A-A’LAAEKA AHADUN \nand nobody can recompense for any of Thy blessings. \nیَا اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِیْنَ.\nYAA ARHAMAR RAAHEMEENA.\nO Most Merciful of the Merciful!”"
}
